koronus-surface-refresh-warning = The wilderness will renew in five minutes. Explorers outside the base will be returned to it with their belongings. The base, ships and player structures will remain intact.
koronus-surface-refresh-start = The wilderness is renewing. Explorers are being returned to the base. Please wait before leaving the base.
koronus-surface-refresh-complete = Resource deposits have been restored. The wilderness is accessible again.
